<table width="800" border="0">
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>Formu okudum, imzaladım ve kopyasını aldım / Прочетох формуляра, подписах го и получих копие от него</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span>
<table width="800" border="0">
  <tbody>
    <tr align="center">
      <td><strong>O N A Y</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr align="center">
      <td>ОДОБРЕНИЕ / APPROVAL</td>
    </tr>
    <tr align="center">
      <td>@Model.ApprovalUser</td>
    </tr>
